  "description": "Today, I was dumped by Kim Yeo-Hee again. Countless confessions, countless rejections. This is love, it was too horrible.\n\n *“You’ve become a fool while Je-Gyeom wasn’t looking?”\n“…That’s okay. Just go home and adjust to the time difference.”* \n\nI was already miserable, but Baek Hyun-Oh, who had suddenly returned from the US, started to tease me with ridiculous words.\n\n *“Hey, what would you do if I seduced her?”\n“I couldn’t do it, so how could you?”\n“I’ll do it. I’m not a fool like some people.”* \n\nIt was a crappy bet. But why? It was funny, but my heart wavered dangerously at Baek Hyun-Oh’s teasing. I shouldn’t have done this, but I wanted to know Kim Yeo-Hee’s true feelings.\n\n *“Just give me three months. I’ll get Kim Yeo-Hee’s button.”*\n\nIt was the beginning of a dangerous bet.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
